WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.625
Burning moves carbon stored over millions of years into the air in years.

2
00:00:05.926 --> 00:00:10.026
Fossil fuels store carbon locked away over millions of years.

3
00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:16.608
Burning about ten billion tonnes a year puts it back into the air.

4
00:00:20.502 --> 00:00:26.252
Oceans and plants take up part; the rest builds up, so carbon dioxide rises.
